    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"RetrospectiveEntryofData-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni allows users to enter data in &quot;Retrospective Entry mode”. This is extremely useful for low-resource settings to support use-cases where back-dated data has to be entered due to </span>system/power/network failure or in cases where doctors have captured drug orders on paper.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3a399f99-ae91-414d-8da9-c592c48b6cbb\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong>Bulk</strong> retrospective data entry is currently NOT supported.</p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b7bd1df1-503c-4ef0-baaf-c3a55273ea57\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Retrospective data entry is currently ONLY supported in the Clinical App.</p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"75cc2741-ab64-44c9-b537-0a202bfb8299\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Sections</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"28bbf201-d4bb-472c-865e-0ceb60581fb2\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114529259/Clinical+App+-+Retrospective+Data+Entry\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114529259\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Clinical App - Retrospective Data Entry</a></li></ul><p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c3ec6e1f-581d-4d29-8e0f-535154dd71bb\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114539569/Retrospective+Data+Support\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114539569\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Retrospective Data - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
